{"id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Selected Internal Proof and Provability Formulas","display":"df-provability-predicate — Selected Internal Proof and Provability Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["92-df-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Selected Internal Proof and Provability Formulas","source":"第 V 章 pp. 61–64、74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 78–81、91、123–124）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Selected Internal Proof and Provability Formulas"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 61–64、74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 78–81、91、123–124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>的本地 P.A. 呈现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 为外部证明码关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 承载结论码、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span> 承载证明码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span>；对于每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\bar m,\\bar k))\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\bar m,\\bar k))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对于每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\bar m,\\bar k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\bar m,\\bar k)\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\bar m,\\bar k)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\bar m,\\bar k)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_{G}(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_{G}(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G)\\)</span>，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a>；这是所选公式的独立可导性条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G,\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G,B_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G,\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G,\\mathrm{Prov}_G,B_G\\)</span>：本定义引入的符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar m,\\bar k))),\\\\\nB_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(n)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B_G;t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(F)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nF\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\land\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\n\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;\\bar m,\\bar k))),\\\\\nB_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(n)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(B_G;t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一次参数选定，Hypothesis 不是从语义正确性自动推导的性质清单。标准模型正确性、正负数码验证、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 层级与 P1–P3 必须分别保证。单独的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrfRep}_G(F)\\)</span> 仍只表示语义正确性，不能用来替换其余条件。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G\\)</span> 接收数项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> 接收外部自然数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_G\">\\(B_G\\)</span> 是基公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(t)\\)</span> 是其无捕获实例；涉及代码时使用实际所得句子的码，不能擅自忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 改名。原书 P.A. 标准谓词的 P3 使用引用结果，详证明确在本书范围之外，故本文件不声称已构造并机器核验全部内部证明。</p>\n<p>可判定或 PR 的外部证明关系未必直接给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 公式。可加入计算见证选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 表示，再合并存在量词；本定义不把当前素数幂编码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 表示当作已完成结果。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 61–64、74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 78–81、91、123–124）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predica